WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.337
Franklin: Hi, I'm Franklin.
I've lived in a lot of different places.

00:00:03.420 --> 00:00:05.380
My family's always on the move.

00:00:05.464 --> 00:00:08.008
(mellow music playing)

00:00:08.091 --> 00:00:10.552
This was it, our new town.

00:00:10.636 --> 00:00:12.596
- Do you want to--?
- (Laughing)

00:00:12.679 --> 00:00:14.056
Excuse me.

00:00:14.139 --> 00:00:15.682
Making new friends can be hard.

00:00:16.975 --> 00:00:19.561
- I’m Franklin Armstrong.
- My name is Charlie Brown.

00:00:19.645 --> 00:00:21.104
♪ "Already On My Side" by Ashley Clark ♪

00:00:21.188 --> 00:00:23.273
The big soapbox derby race
is coming to town!

00:00:23.357 --> 00:00:27.152
The winning team gets a trophy
and free pizza for a whole year!

00:00:27.236 --> 00:00:28.111
(Cheering)

00:00:28.195 --> 00:00:30.322
What do you think Charlie Brown? Partners?

00:00:31.240 --> 00:00:32.324
Charlie: Partners.

00:00:32.407 --> 00:00:33.242
♪

00:00:33.325 --> 00:00:35.410
Hey, Franklin,
what kind of music do you like?

00:00:35.494 --> 00:00:38.330
The godfather of soul, James Brown.

00:00:39.248 --> 00:00:40.874
You’re not related, are you?

00:00:41.667 --> 00:00:43.627
- I don't believe so.
- (Franklin laughs)

00:00:43.710 --> 00:00:45.629
♪ No matter what they say ♪

00:00:45.712 --> 00:00:48.882
Franklin: My grandpa always says
you’ve got to want it to get it.

00:00:48.966 --> 00:00:50.717
Let’s see what we can really do!

00:00:50.801 --> 00:00:52.010
♪

00:00:52.094 --> 00:00:54.471
- (Both yelling)
- Franklin: Friendships are not perfect,

00:00:54.555 --> 00:00:57.182
but we can get through
the rough spots together.

00:00:57.266 --> 00:00:59.518
(Chirping and laughing)

00:00:59.601 --> 00:01:02.563
A best friend is someone
you can totally trust...

00:01:02.646 --> 00:01:04.731
- (Both laughing)
- ...that always has your back.

00:01:04.815 --> 00:01:05.983
(Laughing)

00:01:06.066 --> 00:01:07.442
(Yelling)

00:01:07.526 --> 00:01:09.778
- (Cheering)
- child: Charlie Brown!

00:01:09.862 --> 00:01:10.988
Go, go, go!

00:01:11.071 --> 00:01:13.031
Hey, Franklin,
we saved you a seat over here!

00:01:13.115 --> 00:01:17.411
Franklin: You know you’ve found your home
when you’re surrounded by good friends.

00:01:17.494 --> 00:01:18.745
♪

00:01:18.829 --> 00:01:20.831
♪ Time's already on my side ♪

